{"title":"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For any positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/a/12a32ccd86343368b87352d4313e4f13b91668a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> denote the result when the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are reversed. It is given that there exists a unique set of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/e/54e91ce00788ee5eca8cc4c8a00612069f877a56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{p, r(p)\\}\\neq\\{273, 372\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/5/2255567774d3be4437169cdccd2ba92001cebad6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\cdot r(p)=273\\cdot 372.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" /> Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5dba4ce544dd3a64cf8639e8ac9dd3a59fccd2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+r(p).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Du2A7HbNxoM\">https://youtu.be/Du2A7HbNxoM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I\" title=\"2021 CIME I\">2021 CIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2021\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new